     <td>T.TIME</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>GULF TREASURE</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DANGOTE</td>\n                <td>₦1,576.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>TMDK</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DUPORT</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBACHEM</td>\n                <td>₦1,660.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Trump Rules Out Iran Talks as Strait of Hormuz Crisis Deepens\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    US President Donald Trump has said there are no ongoing or scheduled talks with Iran. Trump, in a post on Truth Social on Tuesday, also maintained that the Strait of Hormuz was open and operating, despite Iran insisting that the strategic waterway remained closed.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/trump-rules-out-iran-talks-as-strait-of-hormuz-crisis-deepens\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Dangote Refinery Attracts $1bn Funding Support Ahead of IPO\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Dangote Petroleum Refinery and Petrochemicals has secured a $1 billion underwriting programme. The programme consists of a $600 million private placement that has been underwritten and funded and a further $400 million underwriting commitment for the proposed IPO.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/dangote-refinery-attracts-1bn-funding-support-ahead-of-ipo\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Trump Declares Strait of Hormuz 'New US Territory' as Oil Prices Stay Elevated\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    US President Donald Trump has declared the Strait of Hormuz a \"new US territory,\" intensifying tensions with Iran. Roughly 20 per cent of global oil supply typically transits the strait, which lies between Iran and Oman. Brent crude was trading around $87 to $90 a barrel last week, with West Texas Intermediate near $82.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/trump-declares-strait-of-hormuz-new-us-territory-as-oil-prices-stay-elevated\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Tankers Turn Back at Hormuz as Iran Tightens Control\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Tanker movements through the Strait of Hormuz have become increasingly unpredictable as heightened security risks and Iran’s efforts to assert greater control over the waterway leave vessels uncertain about when and where they can safely transit. Vessel-tracking data compiled by Bloomberg showed the Amara, a fuel tanker that entered the Persian Gulf empty, making several U-turns after entering the Strait.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/tankers-turn-back-at-hormuz-as-iran-tightens-control\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Brent Surges Past $91 After Vessel Hit in Strait of Hormuz\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Brent crude climbed above $91 a barrel on Tuesday after a cargo vessel was struck by an unidentified projectile while transiting the Strait of Hormuz. The incident was reported by the United Kingdom Maritime Trade Operations (UKMTO), a Royal Navy-sponsored maritime security organisation. The attack comes as tensions between the United States and Iran remain high.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/brent-surges-past-91-after-vessel-hit-in-strait-of-hormuz\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
